Signing recipes
├── compiler
│   ├── binds all masked economic words and fixes domain, pair, recipient and plan
│   ├── rejects overlapping, header and invalid-slippage configuration
│   ├── matches the frontend and executor bounded CoW fixture
│   └── BuildRecipe emits the same executable program and native authorization
├── execution
│   ├── selects the exact amount from the live sell balance and committed cap
│   ├── validates amount bounds, deadline bounds and oracle-derived output floor
│   ├── reads the execution price and rejects stale or zero prices
│   ├── cannot widen committed slippage or bypass the executor role
│   └── overwrites forged runtime economics with checked inputs
└── native layouts
    ├── CoW binds sell amount, buy amount and uint32 validTo
    └── Liquid Lane binds amount, single output, deadline and nonce
